{"supplier":"hotelbeds","supplierHotelId":"663175","name":"Wings Cappadocia","description":"يقع فندق Wings Cappadocia في قلب كابادوكيا في أوشيسار، ويوفر إطلالات خلابة على المناطيد وهي ترتفع فوق الوديان و'المداخن الجنية'. يضم هذا الفندق الساحر عشر غرف فقط، بما في ذلك ست غرف كهفية وأربع غرف حجرية وثلاثة أجنحة، مما يضمن لك ملاذًا هادئًا. يستمتع الضيوف بخدمة الواي فاي المجانية وخدمة الاستقبال وخدمة الغرف على مدار 24 ساعة. تتوفر خدمات النقل من وإلى المطار بسيارة خاصة أو خدمة النقل المكوكية (قد تُطبق رسوم).","address":"Tekelli Mahallesi Derebag sokak no 9","city":"Nevsehir","countryCode":"TR","postalCode":"50240","lat":38.631365,"lng":34.80723290000003,"stars":4,"giataCode":"857838","phone":"+903842193010","email":"HAKAN@WINGSCAPPADOCIA.COM","images":[{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/66/663175/663175a_hb_a_009.jpg","category":"exterior","order":0},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/66/663175/663175a_hb_a_013.jpg","category":"exterior","order":1},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/66/663175/663175a_hb_a_014.jpg","category":"exterior","order":2},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/66/663175/663175a_hb_a_015.jpg","category":"exterior","order":3},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/66/663175/663175a_hb_a_017.jpg","category":"exterior","order":4},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/66/663175/663175a_hb_a_008.JPG","category":"exterior","order":5},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/66/663175/663175a_hb_a_004.jpg","category":"exterior","order":6},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/66/663175/663175a_hb_a_010.jpg","category":"exterior","order":7},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/66/663175/663175a_hb_a_011.jpg","category":"exterior","order":8},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/66/663175/663175a_hb_l_001.jpg","category":"lobby","order":9},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/66/663175/663175a_hb_ro_025.jpg","roomCode":"CU